    <string name="about_message">BlazeMuzix %1$s\n\nA modern, lightweight, ad-free music discovery app for Android 4.4 and newer.\n\nBlazeMuzix does not host music. Online content is provided through the official YouTube Data API and Spotify Web API and remains subject to those services’ terms, availability and playback rules. BlazeMuzix never bypasses DRM, authentication, advertisements or download restrictions of third-party services.</string>
    <string name="licenses_text">BlazeMuzix uses the following open-source software:\n\n• AndroidX libraries — Apache License 2.0\n• Material Components for Android — Apache License 2.0\n• Kotlin &amp; kotlinx.coroutines — Apache License 2.0\n• Glide — BSD, part MIT and Apache 2.0\n• desugar_jdk_libs — GPL v2 with Classpath Exception\n\nYouTube is a trademark of Google LLC. Spotify is a trademark of Spotify AB. BlazeMuzix is not affiliated with or endorsed by either company.</string>

